# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Browser-visible build settings (Vite). Anything starting with VITE_ is baked
# into the public JavaScript bundle, so NEVER put a password, hash or key here.
# Copy to .env.local for local development.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Server secrets are NOT set in this file. Add them in the Cloudflare dashboard:
#   Workers & Pages -> your project -> Settings -> Variables and Secrets
# (use "Secret" type), for both Production and Preview. For local development
# copy .dev.vars.example to .dev.vars instead.
#
#   JWT_SECRET             long random string (32+ chars) that signs login sessions
#   ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH    admin password hash (see SETUP.md for how to generate)
#   ADMIN_EMAIL            optional, defaults to info@sjhomeinteriors.co.uk
#   GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID       same value as VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID (enables Google sign-in)
#   STRIPE_SECRET_KEY      sk_live_... (or sk_test_... while testing)
#   STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET  whsec_... from the Stripe webhook endpoint
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
